	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_SavingPleaseWait:
	.string "正在保存对战数据。\n请稍候。$"
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_CancelYourChallenge:
	.string "要从对战间的挑战中\n暂时休息一下吗？$"
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_RecordCouldntBeSaved::
	.string "出现某种错误。\n记录未能保存。$"
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_SalonMaidenOnHerWay:
	.string "不好意思……\p我们的首领，对战塔大君，\n正赶来与您对战。\p她马上就到。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_ReadyForSalonMaiden:
	.string "您将面对对战塔大君。\n准备好了吗？$"
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_GreetingsImAnabel:
	.string "初次见面……\n我叫莉拉。\p我是对战塔大君，\n负责管理这座对战塔……\p我听过关于你的\n不少传闻……\p说实话，我听到的那些\n一点也不讨人喜欢……\p我来见你的理由……\n其实只有一个……$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_LetMeSeeYourTalent:
	.string "让我见识一下你的\n全部实力吧……$"
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_AnabelTalentShallBeRecognized:
